Their inputs are synthetic: src/testref.rs and examples/record_refs draw every picture and generate every sound with plain arithmetic, so no recorded picture or sound is in them. examples/record_refs made them; run `cargo run --release --example record_refs -- pcod` to make them again. manifest.toml gives, for every file and reference, its sha256, the tool and version that made it and the exact command.

Tools:
- LAME 64bits version 4.0 (https://lame.sourceforge.io)
- flac 1.5.0
- libvorbisenc.so.2.0.12 Xiph.Org libVorbis 1.3.7
- libvorbisfile.so.3.3.8 Xiph.Org libVorbis 1.3.7
- libwebp.so.7.2.0 1.6.0
- pito-codecs 2.1.0
- x264 0.165.3222 b35605a
- x265 [info]: HEVC encoder version 4.3
